rt's selected-relationships.json." :encompassing/topic {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049091} :encompassing/weight 0.5}] :topic/id #uuid "91edf602-4db5-5995-a70e-acdee225f178" :topic/knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087717 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087518 :question/id #uuid "53ce2176-ae44-578d-8fba-35c5018d4162" :question/math-academy-id "e-5075" :question/problem "For the parametric curve\n\n$$\nx=3t, \\,\\,\\, y=t^3, \\quad -3\\leq t \\leq 3,\n$$\n\nfill in the following table of values.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\"><strong>$t$</strong></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-2$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$x$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$y$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n" :question/worked-solution "First, we work out the $x$-values using the formula $x=3t.$ This gives\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\"><strong>$t$</strong></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-2$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$x$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-9$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-6$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$y$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nNow, we work out the $y$-values using $y=t^3.$ This gives\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\"><strong>$t$</strong></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-2$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$x$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-9$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-6$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-3$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$y$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-27$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-8$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$27$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "bbf50e27-a8c3-52e7-be21-5d7ed61e5512" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050790}] :knowledge-point/level-coverage [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698142 :question-generator/id #uuid "b80586aa-f033-54d0-9892-52ba7d05c425" :question-generator/script "generators/e9/e98534e6f6a579edf98679ec13ed814bd5b36b5878707aaae86b7a338c3a83da/generator.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088269} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088270} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186233325} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186233831} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186234248} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186234256} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259554} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259555} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302269} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302270} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302271} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302272} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302273} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302274} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302275} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335928} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335959} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186336019} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557627} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557631} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557649} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557664} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557666} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557670} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557674} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557680} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557691} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557694} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186697642} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186697645} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186697653} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698121} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698122} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698133} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698140} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698141}] :knowledge-point/title "Filling a Table of Values for a Parametric Curve"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087721 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087522 :question/id #uuid "b322617c-ab21-5ce8-997f-2f10813b4280" :question/math-academy-id "e-5098" :question/problem "Plot the graph of the parametrically defined curve\n\n$$\nx=t(t-6), \\,\\,\\, y=t^3, \\quad -2\\leq t \\leq 2.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We need to create a table of values and then sketch the curve. First, we work out the $x$-values using the formula $x=t(t-6).$ This gives\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\"><strong>$t$</strong></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-2$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$x$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$16$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$7$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-5$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-8$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$y$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nNow, we work out the $y$ values using $y=t^3.$ This gives\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\"><strong>$t$</strong></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-2$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$x$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$16$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$7$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-5$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-8$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$y$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-8$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$-1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nPlotting these points, we obtain the following curve:\n\n![](images/f1/f15f25af0c4804dc811a0ab231ba2ef3ecce2ecd12501a1f2d8b9e34b71a505b.png)"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e0dc11d5-8eda-52b1-b7b1-42b481813ff4" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049072}] :knowledge-point/level-coverage [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698438 :question-generator/id #uuid "6aa63052-374d-5cdc-a22b-58803edd7e00" :question-generator/script "generators/e0/e05bbd4bb034c9a637cd5c1bded1fc3b11b434081eb8b2007bd60f4d13bf4a5f/generator.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088027} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088028} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259562} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259563} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259564} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259565} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186281298} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186281377} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186281382} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186281384} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186387437} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186387444} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186389223} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186389236} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186389243} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186393320} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186535253} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186535255} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186535257} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186535260} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186535263} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186535268} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186535273} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186535279} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186535287} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186535294} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186697893} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186697894} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186697897} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698403} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698404} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698408} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698430} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186698431}] :knowledge-point/title "Graphing a Curve Defined Parametrically"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087722 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087523 :question/id #uuid "a792fa16-e1fd-5f30-a128-bbc49a285429" :question/math-academy-id "e-5099" :question/problem "Given that a curve is defined parametrically as\n\n$$\nx=t^2-6t, \\,\\,\\, y=t^4+4, \\quad t \\in (-\\infty , \\infty),\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y?$" :question/worked-solution "Let's consider each variable in turn.\n\n- To find the range of $x,$ we can start by completing the square, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={t}^{2}-6t \\\\  & ={(t-3)}^{2}-(3)^{2} \\\\  & ={(t-3)}^{2}-9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\left( t-3\\right)^2 \\geq 0,$ we can conclude that $x \\geq -9.$\n\n- To find the range of $y=t^4+4,$ notice that $t^4 \\geq 0,$ and consequently $y \\geq 4.$\n\nTherefore, the ranges are $x \\geq -9$ and $y \\geq 4.$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3cbf0ad0-a7c5-5c0f-a06c-9210fdc244ef" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050372} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050580} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050642}] :knowledge-point/level